{
  "name": "params-seed-read-state",
  "about": "seed_read_state 的 projectKey / workspaceCwd / sdkSessionConfig（InProcessGateway.ts:2423-2441：workspaceCwd 为真时先 setSessionCwd；sdkSessionConfig 为真时校验后 setSdkSessionConfig(sessionKey, config, projectKey)，有变化就关会话；最后 router.seedReadState({sessionKey, projectKey, channelKey}) 在该项目里建会话再播种）。alpha 项目里先用一轮 bash 建 seed.txt 并固定 mtime；按 alpha / 不给 / 未登记目录 / 数字 / 空串播种；只给 workspaceCwd（alpha、空串；非字符串的差异见 params-seed-read-state-cwd-type）；带合法、非法、非对象的 sdkSessionConfig；播种后同会话 edit_file 不用先读。",
  "files": {
    "home/.pilotdeck/projects/private-tmp-pdrs-bbx-root-home-work-alpha/.cwd": "{HOME}/work/alpha\n",
    "home/work/alpha/README.md": "alpha\n"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\": \"Seed run\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "prep-done",
      "when": [
        "prep:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_bbx_p\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Prepared."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "prep",
      "when": [
        "prep:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_bbx_p",
          "name": "bash",
          "arguments": {
            "command": "printf 'alpha\\n' > seed.txt && printf 'png' > pic.png && touch -d 2026-01-01T00:00:00Z seed.txt pic.png"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "edit-done",
      "when": [
        "edit:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_bbx_e\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Edit attempted."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "edit",
      "when": [
        "edit:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_bbx_e",
          "name": "edit_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "seed.txt",
            "old_string": "alpha",
            "new_string": "beta"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "ws": "set_permission_mode",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-prep",
        "mode": "bypassPermissions"
      }
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-prep",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "projectKey": "{HOME}/work/alpha",
        "runId": "run-p",
        "message": "prep: make the file"
      },
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "ws": "seed_read_state",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-a",
        "projectKey": "{HOME}/work/alpha",
        "path": "seed.txt",
        "mtime": 1767225600000
      }
    },
    {
      "ws": "seed_read_state",
